RUN: %PLC -c --fpic %S/retain_lib.st -o %t.lib.o
RUN: %COMPILE -i %S/retain_lib.st %S/retain_main.st %t.lib.o && %RUN | %CHECK %s

retain_lib.st is compiled to its own object. The program includes it and links
that object. The retain storage of RetainProgram and retainFb must be defined
only in the object built from retain_lib.st.

CHECK: 2
CHECK: 4
